# 训练/适配器产物：只留脚本与配置，数据与权重排除
#   dist/v8_adapter/      323 MB
#   dist/finetune_bundle/  80 MB（sft_persona_*.jsonl 各 7–8MB）
dist/v8_adapter/
dist/finetune_bundle/
dist/v9_train_bundle/
dist/retrain_pkg_*/
# 但重训包里的脚本与配置要留（供复现）
!dist/retrain_pkg_*/finetune_train.py
!dist/retrain_pkg_*/run_retrain_*.sh
!dist/retrain_pkg_*/config/

# 临时备份与错误日志（改 prompt / 跑脚本时留下的）
*.bak_prompt
*.bak
*.err

